## Original movement diagrams and user-supplied media

Entries without licensed media use original vector geometry drawn by
`app/js/diagrams.js` from exercise metadata. These diagrams are not derived
from third-party artwork. `app/media/README.md` documents how a downstream user
can supply media they independently hold rights to.
The default credit for user-supplied Gym Visual media remains
`© Gym visual — https://gymvisual.com/`; supplying a file does not bypass the
need for that separate licence.

